{
  "slug": "kate-the-career-coach",
  "name": "Kate The Career Coach",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Kate is a career coaching plugin for Cowork built for senior job seekers who are tired of generic advice. Before anything else, she interviews you on your background, goals, and what you're actually optimizing for, so every skill she runs is grounded in your situation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills**, **8 commands**, **3 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `build-profile` (Collect or update Kate's Mnookin Two-Pager profile — a personal profile that grounds all Personal Fit assessments), `debrief` (Run a structured post-interview debrief), `fit-assessment` (Run a structured fit assessment on a job description using Kate's methodology), `interview-prep` (Generate a structured interview prep brief for an upcoming interview), `job-mission` (Generate a structured interpretation of a role's actual mandate and inferred OKRs, expressed in outcome terms), `kate-coach` (Senior career coaching assistant for executive job searches (VP+)), `kate-status` (Show a capability checklist — what's set up vs), `resume-tailor` (Focused resume tailoring skill for creating targeted resumes for specific roles), and 2 more\n- **Commands** (8): `build-profile` (Build or update Kate's Mnookin Two-Pager profile), `debrief` (Run a structured post-interview debrief), `fit-assessment` (Run a structured fit assessment on a job description using Kate's methodology), `interview-prep` (Generate a structured interview prep brief for an upcoming interview), `job-mission` (Get the actual mandate and inferred OKRs for a role you're preparing to interview for), `kate-status` (Show what's set up vs), `run-monitoring` (Run a full monitoring cycle right now), `setup-monitoring` (Set up weekly background monitoring)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `Stop`, `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `granola`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install kate-the-career-coach@claude-community` from `cbellbell-spin/kate-career-coach`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
